// Things We Did Last Summer (1946)

Tempo 72
Keysig F

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove MellowJazzIntro

Begin Solo
    Voice Piano1//Vibraphone
    Octave 4
    Volume f
    Harmony OpenAbove
    Articulate 110
    Rtime 5
    Rvolume 5
    Begin Riff
        8f;g;a;g; 2f;
        8a;b;c+;b; 2a;
        8d+;c+;b;a; 4g;a;
        2.c+;
    End
End

Swingmode On Skew=58
Swell mp mf 4

1         F
2        Dm
3        Gm
4        C7


Repeat
Groove MellowJazz
Volume m

5       FM7      /     D7
6       Gm7      /     C7
7       FM7
8     Adim7      /   D7b9

Groove MellowJazzPlus
Cresc mf 3

9       Gm7      /    Eb7
10      Am7      /    Dm7
11      Gm7      /     C7

RepeatEnding

Groove MellowJazzFill
Volume mp

12      F9    F#dim3    Gm7     C7

RepeatEnd

13      FM7

Groove MellowJazzSus
Cresc mp mf 4

14      Cm7      /     F7
15      CM7      /     F7
16     BbM7      /    Cm7     F7
17     BbM7

Groove MellowJazzSusPlus
Decresc m 4

18      Dm7      /     G7
19      Dm7      /     G7
20      CM7      /    Dm7     G7
21      Gm7      /     C7

Groove MellowJazz
Decresc mp 4

22      FM7      /     D7
23      Gm7      /     C7
24      FM7
25    Adim7      /   D7b9

Groove MellowJazzPlus

26      Gm7      /    Eb7
27      Am7      /     D7

Groove MellowJazzEnd
Decresc ppp 2

28      Gm7      /     C7
29      FM7      /     z!

